---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Legal & Tax Disclaimer — Formation.Legal"
  description="Important legal and tax disclaimers regarding the content and tools on Formation.Legal."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <div class="mb-10 border-b border-[var(--color-border)] pb-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] sm:text-4xl">Legal & Tax Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Last updated: April 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-lg">
      <div class="brutal-card p-6 bg-[var(--color-error-bg)] border-[var(--color-error)] mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--color-error-text)] uppercase tracking-wide mt-0 border-none pb-0">Not Legal or Tax Advice</h2>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-error-text)] font-medium mb-0">
          Formation.Legal is an independent research platform and information service. We are not a law firm, a certified public accounting (CPA) firm, or a substitute for an attorney or tax professional. 
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>1. Informational Purposes Only</h2>
      <p>
        All content, guides, tools (including the Route Planner and Cost Calculator), and materials provided on Formation.Legal are for informational and educational purposes only. The information provided does not constitute legal advice, tax advice, financial advice, or any other type of professional advice.
      </p>

      <h2>2. No Attorney-Client Relationship</h2>
      <p>
        Using Formation.Legal, reading our guides, or interacting with our tools does not create an attorney-client relationship or a fiduciary relationship between you and Formation.Legal. 
      </p>

      <h2>3. Accuracy and Currency of Information</h2>
      <p>
        While we strive to keep our research accurate and up-to-date, laws, tax regulations, and banking policies change rapidly. Information on this site may not reflect the most current legal or regulatory developments. We make no guarantees regarding the accuracy, completeness, or adequacy of the information contained on this site or linked to from this site.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Your Responsibility</h2>
      <p>
        Forming a legal entity, managing tax obligations (including IRS filings like Form 5472 or 1120), and navigating international banking involve significant legal and financial consequences. <strong>You are solely responsible for your own decisions.</strong>
      </p>
      <p>
        We strongly recommend that you consult with a qualified attorney, CPA, or Enrolled Agent who is familiar with both US law and the laws of your country of residence before making any decisions regarding entity formation, taxation, or compliance.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        Under no circumstances shall Formation.Legal, its owners, researchers, or affiliates be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or special damages arising out of or in any way connected with your access to or use of this website or the information contained herein.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
